Package: criptomonitor
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: phor3nsic <phor3nsic@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-pil, python3-evdev, python3-requests, fonts-dejavu-core
